{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"(which was not certified by peer review) is the author/funder, who has granted medRxiv a license to display the preprint in perpetuity.\",\n    \"The copyright holder for this preprintthis version posted May 9, 2025. ; https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.05.08.25327015doi: medRxiv preprint\",\n    \"NOTE: This preprint reports new research that has not been certified by peer review and should not be used to guide clinical practice.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"PMID:40992964 | Subthalamic deep brain stimulation alleviates the gait sequence effect and freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease. (2026)\",\n    \"The copyright holder for this preprintthis version posted May 9, 2025. ; https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.05.08.25327015doi: medRxiv preprint\",\n    \"NOTE: This preprint reports new research that has not been certified by peer review and should not be used to guide clinical practice.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法有全文明确依据。论文多处明确标注 medRxiv preprint，并注明预印本发布日期为2025年5月9日、DOI及未经同行评审，足以支持该研究仍存在使用medRxiv预印本作为来源标识的证据。指控者的说法部分有依据：全文首行确实出现 PMID:40992964 和2026年年份，同时正文及页脚仍明确标记为medRxiv预印本，呈现出不同版本身份并存的情况。但全文没有明确提供该研究正式发表的期刊名称、卷期页码或正式发表声明，也没有说明外部证据记录如何引用该文献。因此，不能仅凭全文确认其所称的参考文献已经指向2026年正式发表的期刊论文，也不能确认外部证据记录存在版本统一错误。两种说法并不矛盾，报告关于预印本标识的说法不应判为误读。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fcc53fd0-f1b5-4425-8ab6-331ad98486c4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T152012702886Z", "elapsed_seconds": 87.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T15:21:40.580755+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": f